<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{.Title}} MCP server</title>
<meta name="description" content="Connect an AI agent to the {{.Title}} MCP server.">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --fg: #111111;
    --muted: #5f5f5f;
    --border: #e4e4e4;
    --panel: #f6f6f6;
    --accent: #111111;
    --accent-fg: #ffffff;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0b0b;
      --fg: #ededed;
      --muted: #a0a0a0;
      --border: #262626;
      --panel: #151515;
      --accent: #ededed;
      --accent-fg: #0b0b0b;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font: 15px/1.6 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px 80px; }
  h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  h2 { font-size: 19px; margin: 48px 0 12px; }
  h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  code, pre { font: 13px/1.5 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  pre {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }
  .url { color: var(--fg); background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 6px; }
  .client { padding: 16px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .client p { margin: 0; }
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  details { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 10px 0; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; }
  summary code { color: var(--fg); }
  summary span { color: var(--muted); margin-left: 8px; }
  details p { white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 8px 0 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>{{.Title}} MCP server</h1>
  <p>Connect your AI agent to Unkey at <code class="url">{{.ServerURL}}</code>. Your client opens an Unkey sign-in where you choose the workspace and the permissions it gets.</p>

  <h2>Install</h2>
  {{range .Clients}}
  <section class="client">
    <h3>{{.Name}}</h3>
    <p>{{.Steps}}</p>
    {{if .Link}}<a class="button" href="{{.Link}}">{{.LinkLabel}}</a>{{end}}
    <pre>{{.Snippet}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{end}}

  <h2>Use a root key instead</h2>
  <p>Clients without OAuth support, and automation, can send a root key from the Unkey dashboard as a Bearer token. The server then has the root key's permissions.</p>
  {{range .RootKey}}
  <section class="client">
    <h3>{{.Name}}</h3>
    <p>{{.Steps}}</p>
    <pre>{{.Snippet}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{end}}

  <h2>Tools ({{len .Tools}})</h2>
  {{range .Tools}}
  <details>
    <summary><code>{{.Name}}</code><span>{{.Title}}</span></summary>
    <p>{{.Description}}</p>
  </details>
  {{end}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
